Value Required LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value DEST_MAC (\S+)
Value CHASSIS_ID (\S+)
Value HOLDTIME (\d+)
Value CAPABILITIES ([A-Z\s]+|NULL)
Value NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE (\S+)
Value NEIGHBOR_NAME (\S+)

Start
  ^Interface\s+Dest-MAC
  ^----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ^\s*Capability Codes:
  ^\s*The total neighbor number:
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${DEST_MAC}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s+${CAPABILITIES}\s+.*?\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s+${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${DEST_MAC}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s+${CAPABILITIES}\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s+${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${DEST_MAC}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s+${CAPABILITIES}\s+${NEIGHBOR_NAME}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${DEST_MAC}\s+${CHASSIS_ID}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s*$$ -> Record
